sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant P as Parser
    participant C as FinancesCommand
    participant O as OrderList
    participant E as ExpenseList
    participant U as Ui

    User->>P: finances
    P-->>C: FinancesCommand
    C->>O: getAll()
    O-->>C: all orders
    C->>O: getPaidSales()
    O-->>C: paid, non-cancelled sales
    C->>E: getExpenses()
    E-->>C: expense records
    C->>U: show financial report
    U-->>User: financial report
